OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor defies council to
OL,4,Ainstall hedgehog sign
OL,5,
OL,6,FA York councillor has put up a hedgehog
OL,7,Fwarning sign himself after failing to
OL,8,Fpersuade the city council to install
OL,9,Fone.
OL,11,FLiberal Democrat ward councillor
OL,12,FChristian Vassie paid for and installed
OL,13,Fthe sign in Wheldrake, following a
OL,14,F10-month campaign sparked by concerns
OL,15,Fover hedgehog deaths on the village's
OL,16,Froads.
OL,18,FVassie said at least five hedgehogs had
OL,19,Fbeen killed in the village over the
OL,20,Fsummer. "It is bewildering that the
OL,21,Fcouncil has sought to prevent warning
OL,22,Fsigns being put up," he said.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
